{"title": "/ok 与 /text：Content-Type 差异", "lines": [
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -si localhost/ok | grep -E 'HTTP/|Content-Type'"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "Content-Type: application/octet-stream"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "默认按二进制流处理，浏览器会弹下载"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -si 'localhost/text?foo=bar' | grep -E 'HTTP/|Content-Type'"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "Content-Type: text/plain"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "default_type text/plain 生效，变量正常展开"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测环境：nginx:alpine 容器 (nginx/1.31.5)"}
]}
